# Local Netlify folder
.netlify

# PDFs — never commit. Real IEPs contain student PII (names, DOBs,
# evaluation results, addresses). Sample PDFs go in test-fixtures/ for
# local testing only; see test-fixtures/README.md.
*.pdf
*.PDF

# Exception: blank official NYSED forms hosted as static download assets.
# These contain no PII (pre-filled only with checkbox defaults + "See
# attached"), so they are intentionally tracked and served by Netlify.
!forms/*.pdf
